  "body": "## Root cause confirmed from captured Vinted HTML\n\nThe exact model row is the interactive control:\n\n`data-testid=\"selectable-item-brand_collection-9977\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"`\n\nThe nested checkbox is rendered inside `.u-no-pointer-events`:\n\n`input[type=checkbox][name=\"brand_collection_ids[]\"][value=\"9977\"]`\n\nSo clicking/checking the nested input/label is not the intended primary interaction.\n\n## Fix\n\n- Click the canonical exact model row first.\n- Treat the exact checkbox only as a state oracle.\n- Require the checkbox to become checked before continuing.\n- If row click does not toggle it, try keyboard activation (Enter, Space).\n- Last resort: dispatch a native DOM click on the exact proven checkbox value.\n- Never click a fuzzy/partial model.\n- Final URL persistence check for the exact `brand_collection_ids[]` remains unchanged.\n\n## Regression\n\nAdds coverage for the exact checkbox selector bound to the proven collection id.\n",
